sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as End User
    participant SPFX as SPFx ShareGPT ChatBot
    participant RET as FastAPI Retrieval API<br/>POST /get-streamed-response
    participant SRCH as Azure AI Search<br/>Shared Index
    participant OAI as Azure OpenAI<br/>Chat + Embedding
    participant GR as Guardrail Validator<br/>Claim Grounding
    participant COS as Azure Cosmos DB<br/>Threads + Messages

    rect rgb(247, 247, 210)
        note over U,COS: Retrieval and Chat Runtime Path
        U->>SPFX: Ask question
        SPFX->>RET: POST /get-streamed-response (chat payload)
        RET-->>SPFX: SSE status: retrieving documents
        RET->>OAI: Generate query embedding
        RET->>SRCH: Hybrid semantic + vector search (top-k)
        SRCH-->>RET: Chunks + metadata
        RET-->>SPFX: SSE status: generating answer
        RET->>OAI: Generate grounded JSON answer
        OAI-->>RET: Streaming answer chunks
        RET-->>SPFX: SSE answer_delta / citation_delta
        RET-->>SPFX: SSE answer_ready
        RET-->>SPFX: SSE status: validating response
        RET->>GR: Validate claims against retrieved context
        GR-->>RET: Guardrail verdict + confidence + issues
        RET->>COS: Persist user and assistant messages
        RET-->>SPFX: SSE final (answer + citations + guardrail)
        RET-->>SPFX: SSE done
        SPFX-->>U: Render final grounded response
    end

    participant SPLIB as SharePoint Document Library
    participant PAF as Power Automate Scheduled Flow
    participant BLOB as Azure Blob Storage<br/>Staging Container
    participant NG as ngrok Tunnel to Ingestion API
    participant ING as FastAPI Ingestion API<br/>POST /ingest
    participant DI as Azure Document Intelligence

    rect rgb(220, 245, 240)
        note over SPLIB,SRCH: Background Ingestion Path (Scheduled)
        PAF->>SPLIB: List recently modified files
        SPLIB-->>PAF: File references + metadata
        loop For each file
            PAF->>SPLIB: Get file content
            PAF->>BLOB: Upload blob
            PAF->>BLOB: Set source_url metadata
        end
        PAF->>NG: Call /ingest
        NG->>ING: Forward POST /ingest
        ING->>BLOB: Read staged files
        ING->>DI: Parse layout + tables
        ING->>OAI: Table summary + chunk embeddings
        ING->>SRCH: Upsert chunks to shared index
        PAF->>BLOB: Delete staged blobs after success
    end
